OL,3,ACanada becoming EU 'associate member'
OL,4,Awould be positive move, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney says he
OL,7,Fwelcomes the EU's "ambition" for Canada
OL,8,Fto become an associate member - here's
OL,9,Fwhat we know, and don't, about the
OL,10,Fpotential partnership
OL,12,FAfter his speech at the European
OL,13,FParliament, Carney says a closer
OL,14,Falliance with the EU is a "positive
OL,15,Fprocess", and will make his country a
OL,16,F"more effective partner" of the US -
OL,17,Fwhat has Canada's opposition said?
